<title>UK: DT Ausgleischbank sets 300 mln mark 8-year FRN.</title>
<headline>DT Ausgleischbank sets 300 mln mark 8-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers DG Bank and HSBC Trinkaus.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DT AUSGLEISCHSBANK</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DEM   BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY    28.FEB.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     -1/16     PAY DATE    28.FEB.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   ISS PRICE  100.115   FULL FEES   20</p>
<p> LISTING    FFT/DUES  DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10	  SELL CONC  10	  PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
